@independence_erc
title: Give independence concessions to ERC
view-if: player_party != "erc" and coalition_affairs_includes_erc and erc_relations < 55
choose-if: coalition_affairs_indy_erc_available
unavailable-subtitle: [? if coalition_affairs_indy_erc_pending: We already owe ERC partner passage of a law. ?][? if not coalition_affairs_indy_erc_pending: [? if coalition_affairs_indy_erc_aligned: Our roadmaps are already aligned. ?][? if coalition_affairs_indy_erc_no_roadmap: Our current roadmap positions are to different. ?][? if not coalition_affairs_indy_erc_aligned and not coalition_affairs_indy_erc_no_roadmap: [? if player_in_jxsi or player_in_jxcat: We cannot change our party's roadmap separately while in a unity list. ?][? if consultation_pending: We cannot change our roadmap with a consultation pending. ?][? if referendum_pending: We cannot change our roadmap with a referendum pending. ?][? if congreso_decidir_countdown > 0 and player_roadmap < 2: We cannot change our roadmap while waiting for the Congreso's right-to-decide vote. ?][? if not player_roadmap_change_trigger: We have changed our roadmap too recently. ?][? if coalition_affairs_indy_erc_faction_blocked: Our party factions are too strong to accept the requested roadmap change. ?]?][? if coalition_affairs_indy_erc_no_law: This partner's roadmap offers no compatible law commitment. ?][? if not coalition_affairs_indy_erc_no_law and not parlament_sovereignty_declaration: A parliamentary Declaration of Sovereignty is required before committing to any further sovereignty laws. ?][? if coalition_affairs_indy_erc_consultations_passed: The Law on Non-Binding Consultations has already been passed. ?][? if coalition_affairs_indy_erc_referendum_passed: The Law on the Referendum has already been passed. ?]?]
on-arrival: {!
    Q.coalition_affairs_concession_target = "erc";
    Q.coalition_affairs_indy_demand = Q.coalition_affairs_indy_demands["erc"];
!}
go-to: independence_demand

